- Run `make test-design-structure`.
- If that fails broadly, run `bash scripts/test-design-structure.sh`.
- Run `python3 -m pytest python/test_design_dialectic.py`.
- Run focused shell tests if assertions show coupling:
  - `bash skills/design/scripts/test-step3-review-cap.sh`
  - `bash skills/design/scripts/test-step3-orchestrator-fence.sh`
  - `bash skills/design/scripts/test-gate-b-apply-mode.sh` (explicit harness for collapsed Gate-B-bypass / cap-reached contract)
- Run `bash skills/design/scripts/test-gate-b-apply-mode.sh` after updating its routing-row pin.
- Confirm new Step 3 entry `not_contains` guards fail on the pre-change `SKILL.md` baseline (two bash fences present) and pass only after collapse to one parameterized fence.
- Confirm new Step 3.5 `not_contains` guards fail on the pre-change `SKILL.md` baseline and pass only after the inline optional-trailer and Gate B resume idempotency blocks are removed.
- Confirm `run_step3b_finalize` negative assertion fails on the pre-change helper (marker at lines 98–99) and passes only after marker removal from the function body.

